Findings will be published in peer-reviewed journals and presented at conferences (e.g. {{ p.dissemination_venues }}), with open-access versions or preprints where possible. Results may also be summarised on UCL webpages and form part of student theses. Only aggregated results and anonymised quotes are published; raw data and recordings are never published.
